   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **01intro**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **03come together**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **04somethin in the way she moves**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **05elanore rigbey**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **06shes so heavy i want you**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **11gonna do it to ya**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **14let me show u the light**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **19crowd**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2011-03-18.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 8 songs; 119 min [1]. Said about its sound: Apart from the early crowd noise, the recording sounds good, according to the taper [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Noisy, clueless audience members whooped and hollered off-beat for roughly the first seven minutes of the show [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2011-03-18.flac16**: taped by taperchris; transferred by taperchris; source: akg c1000s (h.c)ortf 110* & m audio pulsar II x/y 90*>zoom h4n>sdcard 24bit 48hz [1]. Also: Recorded standing eleven feet from the stage, dead center, front of board, in the sweet spot [1]",
